{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/GIF_20250421103914625.gif?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When you opened the coffin, a living person walked out. &quot;It&quot; claims to be from the 21st century, sent back with future tech to save this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/88c835f5df9316a492ac7f2745ac577f.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/cb6c0c41f4de47d1bd95813d3b2590ea.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demon-possessed orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A noblewoman who adopts the orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the nation's general, navigating political intrigue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving among the powerful, you'll slowly uncover the dark secrets behind this brutal country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for gameplay, besides <strong>exploration and puzzle-solving</strong>, I\u2019ve incorporated <strong>somg TRPG dice mechanics</strong>. You can freely <strong>save-load</strong>, pick some <strong>hellish choices</strong>\u00a0to extort NPCs, and fully embrace the role of a <strong>chaotic player</strong> in this dice-rolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ee050b848747d4a3b52719726fec1dac.png?t=1745500915\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1745500915","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1745500915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/bbed65fb741c1f4207351f5943cbe5cba17f3b27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745500915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/bbed65fb741c1f4207351f5943cbe5cba17f3b27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745500915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/GIF_20250421103914625.gif?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When you opened the coffin, a living person walked out. &quot;It&quot; claims to be from the 21st century, sent back with future tech to save this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/88c835f5df9316a492ac7f2745ac577f.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/cb6c0c41f4de47d1bd95813d3b2590ea.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demon-possessed orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A noblewoman who adopts the orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the nation's general, navigating political intrigue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving among the powerful, you'll slowly uncover the dark secrets behind this brutal country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/\u7acb\u7ed8\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1745500915\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for gameplay, besides <strong>exploration and puzzle-solving</strong>, I\u2019ve incorporated <strong>somg TRPG dice mechanics</strong>. You can freely <strong>save-load</strong>, pick some <strong>hellish choices</strong>\u00a0to extort NPCs, and fully embrace the role of a <strong>chaotic player</strong> in this dice-rolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ee050b848747d4a3b52719726fec1dac.png?t=1745500915\" /></p>","developers":["Langgo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/debf585ca0948b3b0a9177e4cb71c15d727b7cfb/header.jpg?t=1745500915","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Derail: Sacrifice \u8131\u8f68\uff1a\u8840\u796d","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 260, ATI Radeon 4870 HD, or equivalent card with at least 512 MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Langgo"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"1 May, 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/768835e5d490632c1694f699b5e7fd6c68f1a0b6/ss_768835e5d490632c1694f699b5e7fd6c68f1a0b6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745500915","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/768835e5d490632c1694f699b5e7fd6c68f1a0b6/ss_768835e5d490632c1694f699b5e7fd6c68f1a0b6.600x338.jpg?t=1745500915"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/d6676f48f0ce7645743feaff939fa276f7811470/ss_d6676f48f0ce7645743feaff939fa276f7811470.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745500915","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/d6676f48f0ce7645743feaff939fa276f7811470/ss_d6676f48f0ce7645743feaff939fa276f7811470.600x338.jpg?t=1745500915"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as